➤ AP QUERY PLAN ON ONE CN(32 core)[12,-1,0]  𝄀
Project  𝄀
  ->  Sort  𝄀
        Sort Key: #[0,3] INTERNAL  𝄀
        Limit: 3  𝄀
        ->  Join  𝄀
              Join Type: INNER  𝄀
              Join Cond: (phase9_main.id = #[1,0])  𝄀
              Runtime Filter Build: #[-1,0]  𝄀
